   "text": "11.5 GB. 155 FILES.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 60
  },
  {
   "text": "This demo is eleven and a\nhalf gigabytes, in a\nhundred and fifty five\nfiles.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.774,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "One of those files is nine\ngigabytes on its own.",
   "start": 5.024,
   "duration": 2.867,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's Stupid Never Dies, an\naction RPG from GPTRACK50,\na studio founded by Capcom\nveterans.",
   "start": 12.141,
   "duration": 7.177,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the build. Unreal 5,\nand the whole game lives\nin one container.",
   "start": 19.568,
   "duration": 4.774,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Most of what's left is\nvideo. Seventy four Bink\nmovies, one point nine\ngigabytes. Two cutscenes\nare a gigabyte between\nthem.",
   "start": 24.592,
   "duration": 8.248,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And a hundred and sixteen\nmegabytes of DLSS. The\nupscaler's neural network\nweighs two thirds of the\ngame's own executable.",
   "start": 33.09,
   "duration": 7.543,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
